<title>UK: Rover says Hasselkus to be chairman.</title>
<headline>Rover says Hasselkus to be chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British car manufacturer, the Rover Group, announced on Wednesday that chief executive Walter Hasselkus would replace Wolfgang Reitzle as chairman of the company.</p>
<p>Rover is owned by German automobile giant BMW.</p>
<p>Hasselkus, who is also on the BMW board, would also retain his role as Rover's chief executive, the company said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
